---
import Section from '../../layout/Section.astro';
---

<Section contained={false} spacing="none" class="pt-16 pb-16 lg:pt-28 lg:pb-28">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mr-auto ml-auto pr-6 pl-6">
            <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-start">
                <div class="max-w-xl text-left">
                    <h2 class="text-left text-4xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white font-manrope lg:text-5xl" data-translate="flexible.title">Flexible and Easy Payroll Running</h2>
                    <p data-garna-subtitle class="mt-6 text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400 font-manrope" data-translate="flexible.description">Garna's goal is to take the unnecessary tasks off the shoulders of your team, so that you can keep growing without distractions</p>
                </div>

                <div class="grid gap-x-8 gap-y-7 md:grid-cols-2">
                    <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-5">
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#CBF300]/10 text-[#CBF300]">
                                <i data-lucide="refresh-cw" class="h-4.5 w-4.5"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="pt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-white" data-translate="flexible.items.automation.title">Automated Payroll Processing</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400" data-translate="flexible.items.automation.description">All the routine tasks are automated now. Send out invoices to contractors, make regular payments and other repetitive work with a couple of clicks</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-5">
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#CBF300]/10 text-[#CBF300]">
                                <i data-lucide="layout-dashboard" class="h-4.5 w-4.5"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="pt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-white" data-translate="flexible.items.control.title">Centralized Control & Visibility</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400" data-translate="flexible.items.control.description">Get a clear view of your payroll costs, payment status, employee pay, and contractor payouts all in one place with real-time insights and reporting</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-5">
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#CBF300]/10 text-[#CBF300]">
                                <i data-lucide="headphones" class="h-4.5 w-4.5"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="pt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-white" data-translate="flexible.items.support.title">24/7 Support</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400" data-translate="flexible.items.support.description">Garna offers global 24/7 support for your finance team, HR, contractors and employees</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-5">
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#CBF300]/10 text-[#CBF300]">
                                <i data-lucide="smartphone" class="h-4.5 w-4.5"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="pt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-white" data-translate="flexible.items.mobile.title">Mobile-First Experience</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400" data-translate="flexible.items.mobile.description">Do payroll on the go with a simple, user-friendly platform designed for teams that work from anywhere</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-5">
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#CBF300]/10 text-[#CBF300]">
                                <i data-lucide="globe-2" class="h-4.5 w-4.5"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="pt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-white" data-translate="flexible.items.reach.title">Global Reach</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400" data-translate="flexible.items.reach.description">Pay people all around the world with flexible payment options including bank transfers, local currencies, SWIFT, SEPA, PayPal, Payoneer, and crypto</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-5">
                        <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                            <div class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#CBF300]/10 text-[#CBF300]">
                                <i data-lucide="zap" class="h-4.5 w-4.5"></i>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="pt-1 text-lg font-semibold text-white" data-translate="flexible.items.earlyPayout.title">Early Payout Access</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-400" data-translate="flexible.items.earlyPayout.description">Give your contractors and employees faster payouts with flexible funding and payment options</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </Section>
